      "writtenOn": "2021-09-17T08:04:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i\u0027m wondering if the boot issues you see are related to\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/3139975\n\nit\u0027s pretty common for us to not have a USB DB plugged in on early boards,\nso i\u0027m a bit surprised at the amount of special case code needed here.",
